# Reference fixes for held-out bench tasks. Tracked: --verify-tasks (CI +
# scripts/verify.sh) needs solution_patch to verify the apply direction, and the
# gate must work in a fresh clone. NOTE: oracle/tests/ is tracked and public
# anyway, so untracking only the patch bought no real contamination cover while
# it broke the gate in CI (see docs/release-provenance.md, F7). The agent never
# sees oracle/ — its workdir is repo/ only — so the patch is not agent-visible
# either way. Contamination on absolute resolve rates remains disclosed
# (oracle_public_in_git); the routing/cost delta is unaffected.
